# The preset (P1 140, P2 110: 79 ms grains, 2.7 overlapping, reach 0.36 s, wide stereo, no feedback) on a saw at
# -12 dBFS: a smooth, wide cloud. The first 49 ms clear the ring (dry only: silence at pan 128), then the cloud fades in.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1
track fx1
input saw 220 0.25
preset 140 110 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
expect sound 1 16
expect peak_below -3
